 (rc msg text)←{connectionParms}∆Compose mailParms;message
⍝ Composes `mailParms` without sending anything and returns the result of `Message.Compose`.
⍝ `connectionParms` defaults to `∆OfflineParms`.
 :If 0=⎕NC'connectionParms'
     connectionParms←∆OfflineParms
 :EndIf
 message←⎕NEW SMTP.Message(⍬ connectionParms mailParms)
 (rc msg text)←message.Compose mailParms
